OL,3,GNEWSACity given #800k to tackle
OL,4,AChristmas homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew accommodation support is to be made
OL,7,Favailable next month in Derby to get
OL,8,Fpeople sleeping rough off the street in
OL,9,FDecember.
OL,11,FDerby City Council has been given
OL,12,F#800,000 in additional funding from the
OL,13,Fgovernment's Rough Sleeping Programme.
OL,15,FIt comes after Prime Minister Andy
OL,16,FBurnham pledged to end rough sleeping
OL,17,Facross the country and offer "a route
OL,18,Foff the street" by Christmas.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
