OL,3,GNEWSACity given #800k to tackle
OL,4,AChristmas homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new measures in the city will
OL,7,Finclude eight supported accommodation
OL,8,Funits at locations around the city, and
OL,9,Fa new six-bed recovery unit at Jericho
OL,10,FHouse, which are all due to open in
OL,11,FDecember.
